From 0af8ea3cdb00c9eab7062269be1b227260c846fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrei <66381299+Andrei-Dr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:38:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: GPU-resident expert cache for host-offloaded MoE
 weights

Rebase of the moe-cache series (PrismML fork, 8c8650b..e29d5bd) onto mainline:
- device-side slot cache with gated LRU admission, async uploads, misses always computed on the host
- fused gate_up / GELU / per-expert scales, 1-4 token batches (speculative verify)
- GGML_TENSOR_FLAG_SCHED_BARRIER: host misses run concurrently with device hits
